FIX's Orchestra files
---------------------

upstream/documents/ holds five Orchestra files that the tests read, each
unchanged:

- OrchestraFIXLatest.xml (FIX Latest as of Extension Pack 312),
  FIXTSession.xml, FIX44Session.xml and TradingDigitalAssets.xml, from FIX
  Protocol Limited's orchestrations repository at commit cd24169
  (https://github.com/FIXTradingCommunity/orchestrations), copyright (c)
  2017-2026 FIX Protocol Limited and licensed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0, whose text upstream/documents/LICENSE holds.
  OrchestraFIXLatest.xml's own metadata says "All Rights Reserved"; the
  repository's licence covers the files in it, and this project copies them
  whole and publishes nothing derived from their text.
- SampleInterfaces.xml, from FIX Protocol Limited's fix-orchestra repository
  at the tag v1.6, under the same Apache License.

A record that scripts/orchestra_xml_to_yaml.py makes from such a file holds
the file's own text, such as its documentation, under that file's terms,
not this repository's. The four files under tests/data/xml/, and the
examples under tests/data/ made from them, are this project's own.

